ent-ClothingUniformJumpskirtDetective = 經年累月穿著的套裝裙 | hard-worn suitskirt
    .desc = 穿這件衣服的人，可是認真的。 | Someone who wears this means business.
ent-ClothingUniformJumpskirtDetectiveGrey = 黑色套裝裙 | noir suitskirt
    .desc = 一位硬派私家偵探的灰色西裝，配有領帶夾。 | A hard-boiled private investigator's grey suit, complete with tie clip.
ent-ClothingUniformJumpskirtHoS = 安保主管的連身裙 | head of security's jumpskirt
    .desc = 它呈鮮紅色，質地相當爽脆，這點與安全人員的受害者通常的模樣頗為相似。 | It's bright red and rather crisp, much like security's victims tend to be.
ent-ClothingUniformJumpskirtHoSAlt = 安保主管的高領衫 | head of security's turtleneck
    .desc = 這是一件高領衫，只有那些足夠強悍且紀律嚴明、足以晉升為安全主管的人才會穿。 | It's a turtleneck worn by those strong and disciplined enough to achieve the position of Head of Security.
ent-ClothingUniformJumpskirtHoSParadeMale = 安全主管的閱兵禮服 | head of security's parade uniform
    .desc = 一名安保主管在特殊場合穿著的奢華服飾。 | A head of security's luxury-wear, for special occasions.
ent-ClothingUniformJumpskirtBrigmedic = 軍醫連身裙 | brigmedic jumpskirt
    .desc = 這套制服是發放給已受過訓練且符合資格的人員。沒人在乎那場訓練只花了半天時間。 | This uniform is issued to qualified personnel who have been trained. No one cares that the training took half a day.
ent-ClothingUniformJumpskirtPrisoner = 囚犯式連身裙 | prisoner jumpskirt
    .desc = 一款供囚犯使用的連身裙。其服裝感測器會隨時自動啟用。 | A jumpskirt used for prisoners. It has suit sensors automatically enabled at all times.
ent-ClothingUniformJumpskirtSec = 保安連身裙 | security jumpskirt
    .desc = 一款採用堅韌材質製成的連身裙，能提供強效的防護。 | A jumpskirt made of strong material, providing robust protection.
ent-ClothingUniformJumpskirtWarden = 獄警制服 | warden's uniform
    .desc = 一套配備 Nanotrasen 皮帶扣的正式警用制服。 | A formal security suit for officers complete with Nanotrasen belt buckle.
ent-ClothingUniformJumpskirtHosFormal = 霍斯的正式禮服 | hos's formal dress
    .desc = 一件適合特殊場合的洋裝。 | A dress for special occasions.
ent-ClothingUniformJumpskirtSeniorOfficer = 高級軍官連身裙 | senior officer jumpskirt
    .desc = 這是保安部門內展現專業能力與聲望的象徵。 | A sign of skill and prestige within the security department.
ent-ClothingUniformJumpskirtSecGrey = 灰色保安連身裙 | grey security jumpskirt
    .desc = 這是過去某個時期的戰術神器，那時 NanoTrasen 尚未決定，將防護服染成紅色比清洗掉血跡更划算。 | A tactical relic of years past before Nanotrasen decided it was cheaper to dye the suits red instead of washing out the blood.
